WEBVTT

00:26.200 --> 00:27.120
You didn't die?

00:29.810 --> 00:30.850
I'm still alive.

00:31.730 --> 00:32.670
Thanks to you.

00:33.060 --> 00:35.550
♪ Time flies like a dream ♪

00:39.380 --> 00:43.050
♪ I remember every moonlight ♪

00:47.170 --> 00:48.470
Two grown men,

00:49.320 --> 00:50.780
acting like children.

00:51.400 --> 00:52.400
Mentor.

00:53.460 --> 00:55.320
I just wanted to see if he was okay.

00:57.490 --> 00:58.640
I'm fully recovered.

00:58.640 --> 00:59.370
I'm fine now.

01:00.610 --> 01:03.090
♪ The memories overlap like a dream ♪

01:01.980 --> 01:03.520
The Zhang family's miraculous medicine

01:03.520 --> 01:04.980
is really extraordinary.

01:06.420 --> 01:12.010
♪ What is lost and found again
runs deeper than farewell ♪

01:15.710 --> 01:17.039
Are you really fine now?

01:21.930 --> 01:24.150
You should worry about yourself.

02:51.160 --> 02:57.350
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

02:57.780 --> 03:00.430
[Episode 16]

03:05.180 --> 03:07.180
The headquarters is still the best.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.300
If I got these injuries in Nanyang,

03:09.300 --> 03:10.300
I'd be dead by now.

03:12.870 --> 03:14.330
It hurts. Be gentle.

03:17.870 --> 03:18.470
Shrimpie.

03:20.090 --> 03:22.950
The three of us
will live a good life here from now on.

03:25.620 --> 03:26.600
You should thank me and Zhang Haixia

03:26.600 --> 03:30.329
for changing your dressings.
That's why you recovered so quickly.

03:30.690 --> 03:32.680
You got like this just from doing a job.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.910
So useless.

03:34.900 --> 03:36.630
I'm not entirely useless, am I?

03:37.400 --> 03:38.730
Didn't I bring him back?

03:40.400 --> 03:41.530
What about his legs?

03:58.579 --> 03:59.770
Didn't Mentor say

04:00.970 --> 04:03.170
that this antidote cures all diseases?

04:04.570 --> 04:06.430
That means there's still a chance

04:06.650 --> 04:08.060
for my legs to recover.

04:12.360 --> 04:13.330
Really?

04:14.120 --> 04:15.050
Are you kidding?

04:17.120 --> 04:17.740
Really.

04:18.990 --> 04:20.620
The Zhang family's miraculous medicine

04:20.620 --> 04:22.079
is absolutely effective.

04:22.160 --> 04:24.160
He has an incomplete spinal injury,

04:24.270 --> 04:26.290
meaning his spinal cord is damaged,

04:26.390 --> 04:28.530
but some neural pathways remain.

04:28.660 --> 04:29.720
In this situation,

04:29.860 --> 04:32.140
the patient might retain some sensation

04:32.390 --> 04:33.540
and motor function.

04:34.570 --> 04:35.840
And Zhang Hailou,

04:36.740 --> 04:38.200
thanks to your dedication

04:38.850 --> 04:40.470
over the past three years,

04:41.070 --> 04:42.300
caring for his legs

04:43.000 --> 04:44.430
and helping him
with rehabilitation exercises,

04:44.430 --> 04:46.960
his muscles
haven't atrophied too severely.

04:47.620 --> 04:48.610
The medicine from downstairs
in the Archives

04:48.610 --> 04:50.940
has already started to take effect on him.

04:51.250 --> 04:53.090
He has a chance to stand up again.

05:07.410 --> 05:08.670
Did you bump your head?

05:10.780 --> 05:11.600
No.

05:13.660 --> 05:15.390
As soon as I came back and saw...

05:17.190 --> 05:18.850
that Shrimpie is still alive,

05:19.950 --> 05:21.580
and his legs can recover,

05:23.150 --> 05:24.640
it just feels a bit too good

05:26.430 --> 05:27.370
to be true.

05:31.660 --> 05:32.520
Stop laughing.

05:45.860 --> 05:47.450
Isn't this the Zhang family's old mansion?

05:47.450 --> 05:49.110
You're the daughter
of the Dong family now.

05:49.110 --> 05:50.540
Why did you move back to the old mansion?

05:50.540 --> 05:51.750
The Dong family was bombed.

05:51.750 --> 05:52.880
It's being rebuilt.

05:53.180 --> 05:54.640
So I bought this place back

05:54.820 --> 05:56.480
in the name of the Dong family.

05:56.680 --> 05:59.010
It feels good
to spend other people's money.

05:59.010 --> 06:00.390
You didn't expect this, did you?

06:00.390 --> 06:01.650
After all these years,

06:01.810 --> 06:03.340
we can still come back here.

06:05.560 --> 06:07.360
From now on, we'll be just like before,

06:07.360 --> 06:08.890
living here together.

06:08.920 --> 06:10.380
How wonderful would it be.

06:28.560 --> 06:29.960
Finally, we're all back.

06:30.170 --> 06:31.450
Let's go look around.

06:32.130 --> 06:32.659
Let's go.

06:34.180 --> 06:34.780
Shrimpie.

06:58.360 --> 07:00.220
Mentor even restored this place?

07:49.810 --> 07:50.830
Mentor!

07:51.860 --> 07:52.640
What is this?

07:57.560 --> 07:58.560
I'm done playing.

07:59.680 --> 08:01.280
Mentor, we're done playing!

08:12.810 --> 08:14.110
Mentor, come out.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.560
We're done playing.

08:31.100 --> 08:31.720
Mentor!

08:32.010 --> 08:33.470
You're tricking me again!

08:36.630 --> 08:38.100
You two idiots!

08:39.100 --> 08:41.169
You fell into such a simple trap!

08:41.940 --> 08:43.280
Stay hungry today.

08:43.630 --> 08:45.390
I can't hold on anymore! Help!

08:46.130 --> 08:46.910
Mentor!

08:50.860 --> 08:52.190
I can't hold on, Mentor!

09:14.890 --> 09:15.860
Zhang Hailou.

09:16.250 --> 09:18.130
You're a member of the Zhang family now.

09:18.130 --> 09:19.740
You need to act like a Zhang.

09:20.750 --> 09:21.970
Starting tomorrow,

09:22.940 --> 09:25.540
you will undergo
the Zhang family's training.

09:26.860 --> 09:27.720
What training?

09:34.600 --> 09:35.890
This.

09:36.600 --> 09:39.250
When you can pull this brick out,

09:39.320 --> 09:41.650
you'll have completed your first lesson.

09:42.010 --> 09:42.950
Take your time.

09:45.480 --> 09:46.320
Are you kidding me?

09:46.320 --> 09:47.290
Cut the crap.

09:49.050 --> 09:51.390
Zhang Haixia also needs to continue
his rehabilitation.

09:51.390 --> 09:52.750
You two do your own things.

09:52.750 --> 09:53.860
Don't bother each other.

09:53.860 --> 09:55.550
We don't have many days to waste.

09:55.550 --> 09:58.170
There are still many things
to handle in the Archives.

09:58.170 --> 09:59.580
Are you even human?

10:00.000 --> 10:02.250
Shouldn't we be reminiscing
about the past,

10:02.250 --> 10:04.280
recalling the good times,

10:04.360 --> 10:05.940
and feeling the moment
at a time like this?

10:05.940 --> 10:07.360
Reminiscing about the past?

10:07.360 --> 10:08.100
Alright.

10:08.750 --> 10:10.600
Then tell me about all the

10:10.630 --> 10:12.830
good deeds you did in Nanyang one by one.

10:13.750 --> 10:14.820
Let's start...

10:15.250 --> 10:16.510
with the Evil God Case.

10:19.440 --> 10:21.360
Th-That's a long story.

10:22.220 --> 10:23.480
Why don't you go first?

10:31.050 --> 10:32.030
Mentor.

10:32.220 --> 10:34.460
Well, it's been 10 years.

10:35.170 --> 10:35.830
It's...

10:36.050 --> 10:37.180
It's all in the past.

10:37.380 --> 10:38.240
Mentor, you...

10:39.630 --> 10:41.430
How come you haven't aged at all?

10:42.450 --> 10:44.020
Share your skincare

10:44.050 --> 10:45.520
secrets with me, will you?

10:46.510 --> 10:47.220
Tell me.

10:49.390 --> 10:52.190
I suddenly remembered
something very important.

10:52.250 --> 10:52.980
Come with me.

10:59.240 --> 11:01.270
[iKiwi Film Company]

11:07.550 --> 11:08.630
The important thing you mentioned

11:08.630 --> 11:10.090
was just coming out to eat?

11:10.600 --> 11:13.500
Me being hungry
is the most important thing in the world.

11:13.500 --> 11:14.740
Why not eat at home?

11:15.360 --> 11:17.220
It's Mid-Autumn Festival today.

11:17.220 --> 11:18.480
Just listen to Mentor.

11:20.170 --> 11:23.800
[Jufang Restaurant]

11:23.600 --> 11:26.430
Miss, gentlemen, your Siguo Soup,

11:27.600 --> 11:28.670
pancakes,

11:30.220 --> 11:31.430
sandworm jelly...

11:32.720 --> 11:33.250
Shrimpie,

11:33.250 --> 11:33.980
have a sausage first.

11:33.980 --> 11:34.860
Stir-fried dried tofu,

11:34.860 --> 11:36.270
pearl meatballs,

11:36.630 --> 11:37.890
fresh fish dumplings,

11:38.220 --> 11:39.790
lovebirds fish rolls,

11:39.980 --> 11:41.510
and American crispy puffs.

11:41.630 --> 11:42.960
All the dishes are here.

11:43.050 --> 11:43.980
Enjoy your meal.

12:05.010 --> 12:05.920
Are you crying?

12:07.220 --> 12:08.550
Have you no conscience?

12:08.600 --> 12:10.050
You didn't even cry for me,

12:10.050 --> 12:11.720
but now you're crying for some food?

12:11.720 --> 12:12.980
You don't understand.

12:13.100 --> 12:15.100
I've been craving this for 10 years.

12:15.440 --> 12:16.090
Excuse me.

12:17.050 --> 12:17.720
Please bring us another round

12:17.720 --> 12:18.670
of all these dishes later.

12:18.670 --> 12:19.550
Okay.

12:20.600 --> 12:22.010
Come on, try this.

12:22.320 --> 12:22.980
Mentor,

12:24.050 --> 12:24.820
can't the cooks in the Dong family

12:24.820 --> 12:26.240
make these dishes?

12:27.670 --> 12:29.890
Of course it's because
there's something good here.

12:29.890 --> 12:30.510
Excuse me.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.660
Coming!

12:32.750 --> 12:33.460
Miss.

12:33.600 --> 12:34.630
I heard you have the best

12:34.630 --> 12:36.600
Green Spring wine in Xiacheng.

12:37.170 --> 12:39.050
I can tell you know your stuff.

12:39.130 --> 12:39.980
Green Spring

12:40.010 --> 12:41.760
is our signature.

12:42.220 --> 12:44.480
Many guests come here especially for it.

12:44.630 --> 12:46.320
What vintage do you want?

12:46.670 --> 12:47.930
The older, the better.

12:48.130 --> 12:50.630
Then it depends on your luck today.

12:51.100 --> 12:52.550
Look, this jar of

12:52.720 --> 12:53.890
20-year-old wine

12:53.760 --> 12:58.400
[Green Spring]

12:53.950 --> 12:55.330
is our best.

12:55.550 --> 12:57.360
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

12:57.360 --> 13:00.050
Whoever wins the dice game

13:00.100 --> 13:01.220
and takes the title of "Top Scholar"

13:01.220 --> 13:03.790
gets this 20-year-old wine.

13:17.210 --> 13:20.050
Four red fours! Top Scholar!

13:17.390 --> 13:18.340
[Four red fours] [Five of a kind with an ace]
[Top Scholar with two aces] [Five kings] [Six fours]

13:20.210 --> 13:21.180
Top Scholar!

13:21.390 --> 13:22.770
You have good luck, Miss.

13:22.770 --> 13:23.550
My turn!

13:40.390 --> 13:42.250
Five of a kind with an ace!

13:42.540 --> 13:44.070
Bigger than four red fours!

13:56.120 --> 13:57.780
[Four red fours] [Five of a kind with an ace]
[Top Scholar with two aces] [Five kings] [Six fours]

13:59.390 --> 14:00.150
Five fours.

14:04.810 --> 14:05.810
Five kings!

14:05.890 --> 14:08.150
The biggest Top Scholar so far!

14:08.550 --> 14:11.480
The three of you
all made Top Scholar in a row.

14:11.500 --> 14:14.350
We will definitely
have good luck next year!

14:14.670 --> 14:15.560
However,

14:14.790 --> 14:18.050
[Green Spring]

14:15.670 --> 14:18.750
we only have one jar of Green Spring.

14:18.940 --> 14:20.820
You three will have to share it.

14:20.820 --> 14:22.050
It's fine. We are together.

14:22.050 --> 14:22.720
Hold on.

14:23.390 --> 14:24.920
Since there's only one jar,

14:24.980 --> 14:27.110
whoever gets the highest roll wins it.

14:27.630 --> 14:28.820
You two brats.

14:28.980 --> 14:30.200
When I started gambling,

14:30.200 --> 14:32.050
your parents were still wearing diapers.

14:32.050 --> 14:32.710
Put it down.

14:33.670 --> 14:34.890
You old woman.

14:34.890 --> 14:36.270
We didn't spend all these years out there

14:36.270 --> 14:37.820
-making a living for nothing!
-What did you call me?

14:37.820 --> 14:39.100
Since there are three of us...

14:39.100 --> 14:39.670
You...

14:40.050 --> 14:41.160
Let's play big.

14:41.860 --> 14:43.170
Whoever rolls the lowest

14:43.170 --> 14:44.010
pays for everyone!

14:44.010 --> 14:44.750
-Great!
-Really?

14:44.750 --> 14:45.250
Bravo!

14:45.360 --> 14:45.830
Really?

14:45.940 --> 14:47.030
Great!

14:47.940 --> 14:48.510
Awesome!

14:48.510 --> 14:48.970
Great!

14:52.480 --> 14:53.550
This big?

14:55.100 --> 14:56.100
Do you have a plan?

14:57.800 --> 14:58.530
You go first.

15:04.750 --> 15:06.390
I learned all my cheating tricks
from Mentor.

15:06.390 --> 15:07.390
What should we do?

15:08.230 --> 15:11.070
Are you stupid?
I also learned them from her.

15:12.100 --> 15:13.550
Aren't you full of tricks?

15:13.550 --> 15:14.680
Think of something.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.610
Six fours!

15:19.670 --> 15:21.500
The biggest Top Scholar so far!

15:22.050 --> 15:23.350
Awesome!

15:24.630 --> 15:25.390
Do you have money on you?

15:25.390 --> 15:26.320
No.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.320
What should we do?

15:28.480 --> 15:29.740
We're on the same team.

15:30.480 --> 15:31.610
He'll pay if we lose.

15:31.890 --> 15:32.420
You do it.

15:55.260 --> 15:56.170
Another one!

16:00.050 --> 16:00.790
Again?

16:00.820 --> 16:01.540
Again?

16:01.560 --> 16:02.600
Again!

16:09.420 --> 16:10.430
Again?

16:11.390 --> 16:12.530
Still winning?

16:12.560 --> 16:13.710
Awesome. Awesome.

16:15.330 --> 16:16.680
A win!

16:16.820 --> 16:17.900
A win again!

16:19.480 --> 16:20.850
A win! A win!

16:20.870 --> 16:22.440
A win!

16:22.470 --> 16:23.870
A win! A win!

16:23.900 --> 16:25.650
A win! A win!

16:25.670 --> 16:27.370
A win! A win!

16:27.390 --> 16:29.430
A win! A win!

16:30.820 --> 16:33.870
A win! A win!

16:34.050 --> 16:37.320
A win! A win!

16:37.340 --> 16:41.320
A win! A win!

16:41.320 --> 16:43.200
Bravo!

16:43.480 --> 16:45.090
Top Scholar with two aces!

16:45.270 --> 16:46.840
Shrimpie, we won!

16:47.050 --> 16:47.830
We won!

16:48.050 --> 16:48.720
Shrimpie!

16:52.050 --> 16:53.360
Congratulations, Top Scholars.

16:53.360 --> 16:54.820
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

16:54.820 --> 16:55.820
Here is a photographer.

16:55.820 --> 16:57.200
He can take a picture of you

16:57.200 --> 16:59.060
to record this wonderful moment.

16:59.940 --> 17:00.650
Mentor,

17:02.270 --> 17:03.870
I want to take it standing up.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.859
Shrimpie, let me help you.

17:26.810 --> 17:28.460
Come on, bottoms up.

17:40.010 --> 17:41.540
It's rare to have good wine.

17:41.900 --> 17:43.260
I want some spicy fish.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.280
Haixia, make it for me tomorrow.

17:47.040 --> 17:47.730
Mentor.

17:48.740 --> 17:51.200
Spicy fish—if he makes it tomorrow,

17:51.700 --> 17:52.900
you won't get to eat it.

17:52.900 --> 17:54.400
You'll have to wait a few days.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.590
Talking back again!

17:55.610 --> 17:57.550
You've been talking back to me
since childhood!

17:57.550 --> 17:59.020
I mean... let's...

17:59.310 --> 18:00.510
Let's talk business.

18:01.050 --> 18:01.850
The Archives.

18:06.440 --> 18:09.440
The Residence was attacked,
the Ship King was killed,

18:09.480 --> 18:11.440
and the Archives were almost made public.

18:11.440 --> 18:14.240
There's been such a huge disturbance
in Xiacheng.

18:14.350 --> 18:16.480
I need time to deal with the aftermath.

18:17.160 --> 18:18.780
I need to go out for a few days.

18:19.310 --> 18:20.900
You two can take the opportunity

18:20.900 --> 18:21.810
to rest.

18:22.050 --> 18:23.810
Rest? Does something this good
really exist?

18:23.810 --> 18:25.200
Let's go fishing tomorrow.

18:25.200 --> 18:27.000
We haven't fished in a long time.

18:27.050 --> 18:28.580
And when Mentor comes back,

18:28.770 --> 18:29.850
we can have spicy fish.

18:29.850 --> 18:31.850
Didn't you use to hate me fishing
the most?

18:31.850 --> 18:33.440
Every time we came out fishing,
you said...

18:33.440 --> 18:34.310
you said I cheated.

18:34.310 --> 18:35.010
This time,

18:35.010 --> 18:36.400
you prepare good bait for me,

18:36.400 --> 18:37.660
and I'll let you get
a three-fish head start. Okay?

18:37.660 --> 18:39.400
Why? Why?

18:43.200 --> 18:46.720
[iKiwi Film Company]

18:48.850 --> 18:49.670
Shrimpie.

18:50.770 --> 18:51.740
So nice.

18:55.730 --> 18:56.480
Look at that!

18:56.550 --> 18:57.440
Look!

18:57.460 --> 18:58.200
It started!

18:58.220 --> 18:59.040
Over there!

18:58.790 --> 19:03.070
[iKiwi Film Company]

19:06.350 --> 19:12.150
♪ The past fades into traces on the page ♪

19:13.440 --> 19:19.150
♪ A silent breeze
brushes past that lingering warmth ♪

19:13.750 --> 19:16.840
[iKiwi Film Company]

19:20.540 --> 19:26.410
♪ In this fleeting world,
I long for a moment of vivid life ♪

19:20.810 --> 19:21.810
So beautiful.

19:27.560 --> 19:32.130
♪ I may have a chance to open a door ♪

19:33.630 --> 19:40.100
♪ Where love and wish
meet in a fleeting moment ♪

19:40.900 --> 19:47.050
♪ There's no need to ask questions
in the maze ♪

19:43.100 --> 19:43.860
Shrimpie,

19:44.270 --> 19:45.610
look at the green one.

19:47.800 --> 19:50.030
♪ The world's bustle ♪

19:50.610 --> 19:55.520
♪ Can briefly warm
those under a shared roof ♪

19:52.800 --> 19:59.780
[iKiwi Film Company]

19:56.600 --> 20:02.290
♪ And the story has come to an end ♪

20:03.140 --> 20:11.080
[Xiacheng News]

20:12.170 --> 20:17.710
[Crossword Puzzle]

20:23.090 --> 20:23.590
Come on.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.240
Try to move.

20:26.010 --> 20:26.470
Come on.

20:30.850 --> 20:31.490
Push.

20:31.660 --> 20:32.010
Yes.

20:34.900 --> 20:35.400
Push.

20:41.550 --> 20:41.980
Good.

20:42.270 --> 20:42.740
Good!

20:43.760 --> 20:44.600
Take a rest.

20:47.410 --> 20:48.870
Let's stop here for today.

20:50.310 --> 20:50.980
Doctor.

20:51.590 --> 20:52.980
How much longer will it take

20:52.980 --> 20:54.310
before I can try to walk?

20:54.980 --> 20:56.640
You're making fast progress.

20:57.850 --> 20:58.910
Miss Dong told me

20:59.160 --> 21:00.400
not to let you rush things.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.400
Get plenty of rest

21:01.590 --> 21:03.050
so you can recover better.

21:03.620 --> 21:04.350
I'm leaving.

21:25.480 --> 21:26.850
Let's go fishing tomorrow.

21:26.850 --> 21:28.240
We haven't fished in a long time.

21:28.240 --> 21:29.740
And when Mentor comes back,

21:29.740 --> 21:31.080
we can have spicy fish.

21:32.700 --> 21:33.500
It's raining.

21:35.510 --> 21:37.110
Will the rain stop tomorrow?

21:47.590 --> 21:49.190
This terrible weather! I...

21:54.160 --> 21:56.160
My good bait is completely wasted.

21:56.550 --> 21:58.680
It wasn't easy to get this Shilixiang.

21:58.770 --> 22:00.630
I was planning to catch a big fish.

22:01.240 --> 22:02.370
The weather is bad.

22:02.850 --> 22:04.200
There's nothing we can do.

22:04.200 --> 22:05.190
I don't think so.

22:05.510 --> 22:06.770
Maybe, with this weather,

22:06.770 --> 22:08.370
the rain will stop in a while.

22:09.010 --> 22:10.070
Let me feel it.

22:14.160 --> 22:15.100
Young Masters!

22:16.400 --> 22:17.440
Are you going out?

22:17.980 --> 22:18.530
There...

22:18.810 --> 22:20.050
We've had a typhoon these past few days,

22:20.050 --> 22:21.270
and it'll probably last a few more days.

22:21.270 --> 22:22.670
It's better not to go out.

22:24.050 --> 22:25.980
-It's all wet.
-This weather is awful.

22:25.980 --> 22:27.900
Could it be the heavenly ghost
making trouble in Xiacheng?

22:27.900 --> 22:29.810
I heard that
when the heavenly ghost appears,

22:29.810 --> 22:31.610
bad things will happen.

22:31.660 --> 22:32.510
Really?

22:37.660 --> 22:38.350
What year is this?

22:38.350 --> 22:40.280
They still believe this nonsense?

22:41.980 --> 22:42.610
Shrimpie,

22:43.770 --> 22:45.170
let's do something else.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.400
What should we do?

23:03.350 --> 23:05.440
Now that I suddenly have some free time,

23:05.440 --> 23:06.700
I don't know what to do.

23:08.400 --> 23:09.800
How about playing chess?

23:11.310 --> 23:12.770
That's boring.

23:14.400 --> 23:16.530
Why don't we play something exciting?

23:21.440 --> 23:22.580
Put me down!

23:22.660 --> 23:24.460
Zhang Hailou, put me down!

23:25.400 --> 23:26.900
Put me down!

23:26.920 --> 23:28.000
I won't!

23:28.970 --> 23:30.180
Sit tight, Shrimpie!

23:31.610 --> 23:32.050
Stop!

23:32.070 --> 23:32.730
Turn right!

23:34.940 --> 23:35.730
Shrimpie,

23:36.090 --> 23:37.690
the weather is finally fine.

23:37.700 --> 23:38.550
Let's go sea fishing.

23:38.550 --> 23:40.080
You call this fine weather?

23:40.200 --> 23:41.700
I can't go.

23:42.240 --> 23:43.480
Isn't the boat right there?

23:43.480 --> 23:44.540
Just bring it over.

23:44.810 --> 23:45.770
The sea is too rough.

23:45.770 --> 23:47.110
We can't go out to sea.

23:47.270 --> 23:48.500
I'll pay you more.

23:49.090 --> 23:50.570
It's not about money.

23:51.010 --> 23:52.230
Why can't we go?

23:52.850 --> 23:54.240
The sea is too rough.

23:54.240 --> 23:56.770
-I'll double it, okay?
-Still dreaming things can be like they used to be?

23:56.770 --> 23:58.360
Why can't I make you understand?

23:58.360 --> 23:59.740
These waves aren't dangerous at all.

23:59.740 --> 24:01.940
You're just a burden now.

24:02.160 --> 24:02.940
Figure it out yourself.

24:02.940 --> 24:04.620
Why can't I reason with you?

24:05.400 --> 24:06.240
If you want to go so badly,

24:06.240 --> 24:08.100
find someone else to take you. Go.

24:08.810 --> 24:11.300
Trash shouldn't be alive.

24:11.550 --> 24:12.540
Like I care!

24:14.350 --> 24:15.310
Don't hold me up.
I need to haul in the net and go home.

24:15.310 --> 24:16.640
Stop fooling yourself.

24:25.670 --> 24:26.930
[Excessive use of strychnine may lead to madness;
physicians should prescribe with utmost caution.]

24:27.040 --> 24:29.180
[Long-term use
may lead to personality changes.]

24:30.470 --> 24:32.070
What is wrong with me lately?

24:32.220 --> 24:32.470
[Long-term use
may lead to personality changes.]

24:32.680 --> 24:34.490
[Pharmacy]

24:36.580 --> 24:37.420
[Pharmacy]

24:42.600 --> 24:43.410
Mr. Zhang,

24:43.590 --> 24:45.810
there is nothing wrong with your health.

24:45.810 --> 24:47.550
You can stay under observation
for a while.

24:47.550 --> 24:49.480
Come to me if you have any problems.

26:17.790 --> 26:18.400
[Award of Commendation]

26:48.900 --> 26:49.550
Mimi,

26:49.590 --> 26:50.600
come down!

26:55.200 --> 26:57.040
Mimi, come down!

27:08.270 --> 27:09.240
Come down.

27:09.810 --> 27:10.440
Come down.

27:14.320 --> 27:14.990
Let me do it.

27:18.510 --> 27:19.510
Can you?

27:37.700 --> 27:39.350
Who told you
to throw the stone at the cat?

27:39.350 --> 27:40.850
You almost killed it!

27:40.900 --> 27:41.830
-Yuanbao!
-I...

27:41.850 --> 27:42.530
Come down!

27:42.770 --> 27:43.570
Come down!

27:43.850 --> 27:44.590
Are you okay?

27:46.310 --> 27:47.370
What are you doing?

27:48.480 --> 27:49.510
I was just trying to help.

27:49.510 --> 27:50.160
Mother,

27:50.270 --> 27:51.770
he threw a stone at Mimi!

27:51.850 --> 27:52.310
I...

27:52.310 --> 27:52.850
Stop it!

27:53.480 --> 27:55.810
Doing such a despicable thing at your age!

27:55.900 --> 27:57.160
Shameless!

27:58.930 --> 28:00.330
Are you going to explain?

28:01.380 --> 28:03.440
Will they believe you if you explain?

28:07.700 --> 28:10.310
No one can even understand
your good intentions,

28:10.310 --> 28:12.690
let alone believe anything else you say.

28:13.400 --> 28:15.730
Zhang Hailou and your mentor are the same.

28:25.660 --> 28:29.400
[No animals were hurt
during the shooting]

28:39.400 --> 28:40.630
Give me the cat!

28:41.660 --> 28:42.700
Let me go! You...

28:43.350 --> 28:44.460
Let go! You're hurting me!

28:44.460 --> 28:47.320
-Let go of my mother!
-Yuanbao! Come back! Yuanbao!

28:47.590 --> 28:48.390
Let me go!

28:48.550 --> 28:49.780
You're hurting me!

28:52.850 --> 28:53.660
No!

28:54.440 --> 28:55.810
Let go of my mother!

28:59.810 --> 29:01.060
Give me the cat!

29:01.200 --> 29:01.980
Let's go!

29:01.980 --> 29:03.330
Let's go home! Hurry!

29:22.440 --> 29:23.270
I...

29:34.810 --> 29:35.480
Young Master,

29:35.480 --> 29:37.440
you're awake? Breakfast is ready.

30:30.970 --> 30:33.190
[Murder]

30:33.290 --> 30:35.950
[Crossword Puzzle]

30:40.290 --> 30:41.150
[Murder]

30:46.240 --> 30:47.680
[Murder]

30:49.460 --> 30:55.390
[Murder]

31:05.090 --> 31:06.550
Young Master, the doctor is here.

31:06.550 --> 31:08.350
He is waiting for you in the room.

31:14.050 --> 31:14.850
Young Master?

31:16.900 --> 31:17.830
What's the rush?

31:18.900 --> 31:19.700
I'm coming.

31:26.590 --> 31:27.980
Great. Yes.

31:28.160 --> 31:29.290
Take a step. Come on.

31:29.480 --> 31:30.360
Be careful.

31:31.740 --> 31:32.430
Be careful.

31:33.010 --> 31:34.050
Yes, very good.

31:34.850 --> 31:35.240
Yes.

31:35.940 --> 31:36.400
Come on.

31:36.850 --> 31:37.510
A little more.

31:37.510 --> 31:37.980
Yes.

31:40.640 --> 31:41.370
Are you okay?

31:43.550 --> 31:44.090
Steady.

31:45.550 --> 31:46.010
Come on.

32:03.850 --> 32:04.310
Come on.

32:05.810 --> 32:06.270
Good.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.690
You can do it.

32:13.770 --> 32:14.630
Yes, very good.

32:14.880 --> 32:15.340
Come on.

32:15.510 --> 32:16.110
Slow down.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.420
Be careful. Steady.

32:23.590 --> 32:24.270
Hold on.

32:24.330 --> 32:25.680
Good. Keep your balance.

32:25.680 --> 32:26.140
Come on.

32:26.510 --> 32:26.980
Come on.

32:27.310 --> 32:28.440
You're doing great.

32:29.000 --> 32:29.460
Come on.

32:29.850 --> 32:30.450
Good.

32:32.910 --> 32:33.440
Good.

32:36.670 --> 32:37.500
No rush.

32:38.180 --> 32:39.610
You were being awesome today.

32:39.610 --> 32:41.870
Let's stop here. I'll get you some water.

32:46.010 --> 32:47.100
Run!

32:52.220 --> 32:52.900
Slow down!

32:52.900 --> 32:53.890
We're taking off!
